10 REM A DUE DAY MOVED PAST THE SKIPPED WEEKDAYS (BOWLINE_RULES.H BW1): THE
11 REM FIRST DAY ON OR AFTER DAY D, IN DAYS SINCE 1970-01-01 (A THURSDAY),
12 REM WHOSE WEEKDAY IS NOT IN THE MASK S (BIT 0 MONDAY .. BIT 6 SUNDAY).
13 REM D IS 0 .. 2932896 (9999-12-31) AND S 0 .. 126, SINCE A MASK OF
14 REM EVERY DAY LEAVES NO DAY; THE ANSWER MAY NOT PASS 9999-12-31.
20 INPUT D, S
30 IF D < 0 THEN 300
40 IF D > 2932896 THEN 300
50 IF S < 0 THEN 300
60 IF S > 126 THEN 300
70 FOR K = 0 TO 6
80 LET W = D + K + 3
90 LET W = W - INT(W / 7) * 7
100 LET M = S
110 IF W = 0 THEN 150
120 FOR J = 1 TO W
130 LET M = INT(M / 2)
140 NEXT J
150 IF M - INT(M / 2) * 2 = 0 THEN 200
160 NEXT K
170 GOTO 300
200 IF D + K > 2932896 THEN 300
210 PRINT D + K
220 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
